		'question_text' => 'What is the primary difference between scope of practice and scope of competence?',
		'option_a' => 'Scope of practice is determined by law, while scope of competence is determined by the clinician\'s training, education, and skill',
		'option_b' => 'Scope of practice applies only in private practice, while scope of competence applies only in agencies',
